  "historyNote": "#5777, INTERIM, eff 1-28-94, EXPIRES: 5-28-94; ss by #5829, eff 5-24-94, EXPIRED: 5-24-00 New. #7289, eff 6-1-00 (renumbered by #9163, formerly Fis 303.15), EXPIRED: 6-1-08 New. #9332, INTERIM, eff 11-27-08; ss by #9405, eff 3-7-09; amd by #9720-A, eff 6-5-10, (para (a)); amd by #9720-B, eff 6-5-10, (para (b)); ss by #12591, eff 7-25-18; ss by #13211, eff 5-26-21; ss by #14308, eff 7-10-25, EXPIRES: 7-10-35",
